#: ../../source/features/kv-event-sync.rst:16
msgid "**AIBrix Cache**: Manages subscriptions and processes events"
msgstr "**AIBrix Cache** ：管理订阅并处理事件"

#: ../../source/features/kv-event-sync.rst:17
